# Location of the backend API for this build.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is git-ignored) for local work, or set the
# repository variable VITE_API_URL in GitHub (Settings -> Secrets and variables ->
# Actions -> Variables) for the deployed site.
#
# Leave it unset and the whole site still works in guest mode: the wallet,
# inventory, case battles and the upgrader all run from the browser's local
# storage, and no request is ever made to localhost.
#
# Never commit a real .env file. Only VITE_* values are exposed to the browser by
# design, so this must never hold a secret - the API URL is public information.
VITE_API_URL=
